1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,880
Rory: Do you remember when we played Catten with Bobby last week?

2
00:00:03,230 --> 00:00:06,750
Dev: Yeah. Four hours. He wouldn't let anyone trade for wood.

3
00:00:07,050 --> 00:00:10,410
Rory: Don't you get a feeling... when you watch him play like that?

4
00:00:10,910 --> 00:00:14,570
Dev: Wha... what do you mean? Like rage? Because yeah, I felt that.

5
00:00:14,870 --> 00:00:19,220
Rory: No. Not rage. It's more... in the chest.

6
00:00:19,120 --> 00:00:22,160
Dev: That's acid reflux, mate. That's the Doritos.

7
00:00:22,560 --> 00:00:28,440
Rory: The way he moves the pieces. The way he builds. That long... long road of his.

8
00:00:28,740 --> 00:00:30,900
Dev: I... guess? It was twelve roads long.

9
00:00:31,150 --> 00:00:33,440
Rory: Twelve. Exactly.

10
00:00:33,940 --> 00:00:35,730
Dev: Rory. It's a board game.

11
00:00:36,030 --> 00:00:41,630
Rory: He didn't even look at the dice. Just a flick of the wrist. Nine. Of course it was a nine.

12
00:00:41,930 --> 00:00:43,610
Dev: I thought he was just good at it...

13
00:00:44,210 --> 00:00:48,310
Rory: So... you also find him sexy when he plays Catten?
